{"id":"bf48ee514bb23e587897a4175acf9da6124aa5c3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231255","title":"最新的 deepseek-v4-flash 正式版真的有这么强吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"jxl594","excerpt":"程序员 - @jxl594 - deepseek-v4-flash 正式版卡在 7 月最后一天发布，看评测数据很强，受不了智谱这种涨价方式，梁圣才是中国 AI 真正的希望","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>deepseek-v4-flash 正式版卡在 7 月最后一天发布，看评测数据很强，受不了智谱这种涨价方式，梁圣才是中国 AI 真正的希望</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17924958\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/87faf187f947a6cc869ee86999d5a2a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xqk111\" data-uid=\"332732\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xqk111\">xqk111</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:26:26 +08:00\">23h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看跑分，超过了 grok4.5 ，感觉很强啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17924974\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/87faf187f947a6cc869ee86999d5a2a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xqk111\" data-uid=\"332732\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xqk111\">xqk111</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:27:50 +08:00\">23h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>也超过了 glm5.2 ，有点牛</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17924980\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/576c9d4f1082ef624e59637e2030cd2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"seakingii\" data-uid=\"143924\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seakingii\">seakingii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:29:08 +08:00\">23h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>希望是真的.DS FLASH 才是真的用的起的模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17924987\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:30:21 +08:00\">23h 23m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 21</span>\n                    \n                    <p>是很强，但是 V 站上大部分，不都是非 Fable5 或 5.6Sol 不用的高级用户么？<br>DS V4 Flash 强不强，和他们似乎关系不大吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925021\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fbfb465b1b1e2d0baf8ad70bb7b8327b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jxl594\" data-uid=\"443675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:34:22 +08:00\">23h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>关键是，v4-flash 版本如果能达到 GLM5.2 的水平，那真是太便宜了，GLM5.2 和 KIMI3 可以暂时拜拜了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925045\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/291465e3b42e38a4692ac53abee6eff6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jokcylou\" data-uid=\"215708\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jokcylou\">jokcylou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:38:20 +08:00\">23h 15m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>glm 股价 200 可期</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925067\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fbfb465b1b1e2d0baf8ad70bb7b8327b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jxl594\" data-uid=\"443675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:42:48 +08:00\">23h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/TomatoCLI\">TomatoCLI</a> 对的，不过便宜比快更重要，后面看看小米 MIMO 能不能追上来。<br>真是又期待，又害怕。能力强又便宜，那就能用得起了，但是，另一方面，程序员的含金量 K 线，感觉还在下降通道中。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925085\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/780f/3cc6/627042_normal.png?m=1785488079\" alt=\"yiranw09\" data-uid=\"627042\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:45:43 +08:00\">23h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>刚才试了一下，感觉超过了之前的 dsv4pro ，关键似乎还降级了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925096\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d91357022a60466494cd46bf06f2a5ad?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vitozyl\" data-uid=\"719896\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vitozyl\">vitozyl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:47:10 +08:00\">23h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>能用+够用才是正途. 智谱被称为中国的 Anthropic, 但也不能照搬全学呀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925140\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f75/62fc/674233_normal.png?m=1710605671\" alt=\"Faintlike\" data-uid=\"674233\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Faintlike\">Faintlike</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:53:35 +08:00\">22h 59m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>280b 秒了 740b ，肥鲸，现在的你，强的可怕...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925152\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/23be/c0ef/266992_normal.png?m=1662600177\" alt=\"penll\" data-uid=\"266992\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/penll\">penll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:55:12 +08:00\">22h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>非常牛逼，超过 GLM5.2</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925160\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e628/45cb/406440_normal.png?m=1556620433\" alt=\"cjhyy\" data-uid=\"406440\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cjhyy\">cjhyy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 15:55:56 +08:00\">22h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>虽然 cc 和 codex 拉满了 但是自己总要搞点活啊 目前的感觉来看。模型的快速跃升期要到瓶颈了 60 分与 80 的差别可能不会那么大了 速度和成本应该下一个方向。之前自己充了 300 块 deepseek 用 pro 太慢了。flash 反而用的还顺手一点 做一些简单的活又便宜又快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925182\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fbfb465b1b1e2d0baf8ad70bb7b8327b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jxl594\" data-uid=\"443675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:00:21 +08:00\">22h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/cjhyy\">cjhyy</a> 确实，真正使用的时候，速度很重要，Qwen3.8-Max-Preview 运行一半就卡死在那里，GLM5.2 之前也慢的要死，正常工作几乎不可用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925208\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fbfb465b1b1e2d0baf8ad70bb7b8327b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jxl594\" data-uid=\"443675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:03:39 +08:00\">22h 49m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>要是梁圣再开源一个好用的 harness 项目，那真是功德圆满了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925385\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6ed4/9287/102526_normal.png?m=1784958900\" alt=\"Dream4U\" data-uid=\"102526\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Dream4U\">Dream4U</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:30:13 +08:00\">22h 23m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a> #4 主要是 20X Codex 用不完，天天重置，三个人分摊，一个人两三百，真是最便宜的套餐了。<br>DS 看 API 价格是便宜，但如果用 Pro ，一天几十上百很正常。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925459\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/968fc1db4487a6c2a94f256960940a6f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"stdout\" data-uid=\"368529\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:40:15 +08:00\">22h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1kw token 不到 5 毛，用的越久 cache 命中越高，跟不要钱似的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925468\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fbfb465b1b1e2d0baf8ad70bb7b8327b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jxl594\" data-uid=\"443675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:43:01 +08:00\">22h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a> 目前跑了 3.4kw token ，价格 1.5 ￥，去 TM 的 coding planning ，用多少花多少才是真香</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925499\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/780f/3cc6/627042_normal.png?m=1785488079\" alt=\"yiranw09\" data-uid=\"627042\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:48:58 +08:00\">22h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode go 可以用正式版本了<br>但是需要在后台开启“启用部署在中国的模型”</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925514\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/968fc1db4487a6c2a94f256960940a6f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"stdout\" data-uid=\"368529\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:50:46 +08:00\">22h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jxl594\">jxl594</a> 国内唯一个能用的很爽的，能和 grok4.5 流畅，解决大部分问题不用反复问，我就非常满足了。deepseek falsh 已经满足我的需求了。我下个月把 grok 切换过来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/968fc1db4487a6c2a94f256960940a6f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"stdout\" data-uid=\"368529\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:53:06 +08:00\">22h 0m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 7</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我做空了 minimax 和智谱，赚多少就充多少给 deepseek</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925545\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/edca324d47716a2926b39c2c75184adb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"526457385\" data-uid=\"648590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/526457385\">526457385</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:54:25 +08:00\">21h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我问一下各位啊，哪个模型出来跑分不是吊打其他所有模型，你们看看你们现在正在用的什么模型 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/6DMydmQ.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6DMydmQ.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925619\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c79432e5af5976d2dad325326e6a20b0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"damila\" data-uid=\"625247\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/damila\">damila</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:03:55 +08:00\">21h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我基本不看跑分，但是刚才体验了一下，效果远超个人预期，而且很快，这波是梁圣</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925650\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d075/5f8d/177584_normal.png?m=1773135146\" alt=\"EngelEyes\" data-uid=\"177584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EngelEyes\">EngelEyes</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:10:05 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>反正比隔壁\"性价比首选\"\"对标美系旗舰\"强。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925697\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:17:09 +08:00\">21h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道 DeepSeek v4 pro 正式版能不能达到 GPT5.6 SOL 水平，能达到那就棒了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925715\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/de2d528207fa8e8f4fd3b4e4365e3626?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"albin504\" data-uid=\"503851\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/albin504\">albin504</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:20:31 +08:00\">21h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>利好腾讯啊。 腾讯的 AI 产品能用好低价、开源的模型，真是福音</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925738\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e6ce/37a3/407237_normal.png?m=1715845084\" alt=\"BuffDog\" data-uid=\"407237\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>48</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BuffDog\">BuffDog</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:26:28 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我试了下相当不错，比 v4 pro 预览版强不少</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925789\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/974c/f0b1/157221_normal.png?m=1711449099\" alt=\"kera0a\" data-uid=\"157221\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>49</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kera0a\">kera0a</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:38:22 +08:00\">21h 15m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>flash 都这忘了，pro 不得起飞咯</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925801\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc62/47ff/71403_normal.png?m=1429072930\" alt=\"mgcnrx11\" data-uid=\"71403\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mgcnrx11\">mgcnrx11</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:43:02 +08:00\">21h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>它自己公布的跑分下，有行小字：对于公开基准测试集中的 Code Agent 任务，正式版 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 使用 DeepSeek Harness (即将发布)的极简模式作为框架进行测试，并使用 max 档位，topp=0.95 ，temperature=1.0;</p><p>不能看跑分就认为是模型进步了的，harness 对跑分的影响也非常大的</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925819\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/596e/14c9/33424_normal.png?m=1769153920\" alt=\"min\" data-uid=\"33424\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/min\">min</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:48:05 +08:00\">21h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那 pro 出来了的话还得了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926147\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d23bd22871bf314daf563bcd65a0952d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pinylin\" data-uid=\"331867\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pinylin\">pinylin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 20:52:28 +08:00\">18h 1m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我觉得智商不行， 非常简单的任务都错了。5.6 Luna-max 和 qwen3.7-max  都正常</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926228\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d0d/afd5/386372_normal.png?m=1762346837\" alt=\"ZeroDu\" data-uid=\"386372\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>55</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ZeroDu\">ZeroDu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 21:40:43 +08:00\">17h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek ，glm 现在就差多模态。glm 这一涨价都赶上 gpt 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926247\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a127/02a0/508386_normal.png?m=1604133139\" alt=\"raphx\" data-uid=\"508386\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/raphx\">raphx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 21:58:48 +08:00\">16h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不支持多模态......</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926282\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>58</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 22:27:15 +08:00\">16h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ota\">ota</a> 苹果用户的高贵怎么可以被国产安卓模型玷污？（ CodeX 用户只能算是半苹果半安卓）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>59</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 23:05:49 +08:00\">15h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>苹果用户只用苹果模型（ Fable5 ），绝对不会碰安卓模型。当然，苹果用户也许失业后送外卖，但部妨碍他们的高贵</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ee1d/b97a/59470_normal.png?m=1785060535\" alt=\"oIIo\" data-uid=\"59470\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>61</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oIIo\">oIIo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 00:03:59 +08:00\">14h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在 Codex 里高强度用了 4 个小时，审核 3d 即时战略游戏战斗模块/寻路模块代码（找 bug 、优化项）以及某功能模块实现，更复杂的问题还没试过。感觉 gpt-5.6 terra 没多大区别，关键是干完这些才花了不到 4 块钱....</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926441\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8c3356ac3d300ccd07161f0612e96ea6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"DinnyXu\" data-uid=\"523242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>62</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DinnyXu\">DinnyXu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 01:10:21 +08:00\">13h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/congminhcap246\">congminhcap246</a> 我看了一圈觉得 opus5 很好看，是一个旋风一样，gpt5.6 是不是没用对啊，也太撇了吧，我可是刚买的 plus 啊，这效果不应该啊，另外 ds 的很好看，想宇宙一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926495\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/815e/7994/364343_normal.png?m=1704277462\" alt=\"cue\" data-uid=\"364343\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cue\">cue</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 03:46:38 +08:00\">11h 6m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>重仓算力和光通信的同学又有福了，好日子还在后面呢🫠🫠</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926519\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0d34/713e/304279_normal.png?m=1723516886\" alt=\"gdw1986\" data-uid=\"304279\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>65</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gdw1986\">gdw1986</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 05:45:13 +08:00\">9h 8m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让你们说得热血沸腾的，在考虑要不要直接换 DeepSeek 了，也不用折腾 codex 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926524\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9e622c59c2941759aac210f5e285c194?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kuaner\" data-uid=\"17270\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>66</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuaner\">kuaner</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 06:11:39 +08:00\">8h 41m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>精准狙击 GLM 涨价，显得无比滑稽</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926641\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0715/d0f5/464874_normal.png?m=1774578043\" alt=\"germain\" data-uid=\"464874\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>69</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/germain\">germain</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 09:20:47 +08:00\">5h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我做了一个实操的 code review 和纠错实验，我让 Deepseek v4 flash (OpenCode)去 review 我一个在 GPT 5.6 Sol Ultra 做的项目，Deepseek v4 flash 找出了 41 个问题并实施了修改。</p><p>然后我再用 GPT 5.6 Sol Ultra 去 review ds v4 flash 做的修改，sol 最终报 ds 准确找出了 38 个问题，3 个问题 sol 认为它自己写的没错并 revert 了 ds 的修改。在 38 个问题里，ds 正确修复了 26 个，其余 12 个修复不完整或不安全，随后 sol 完成了 12 个剩余问题的修复。 </p><p>这个能力已经远远超出了我对 ds v4 flash 的能力的心理预期，再加上土一样的价格。。。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f506/f2bc/375728_normal.png?m=1546831481\" alt=\"HinamiAoi\" data-uid=\"375728\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>70</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HinamiAoi\">HinamiAoi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 09:51:18 +08:00\">5h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试了下不错，主要快。<br>拿 AI 干活的就知道速度其实蛮重要的。<br>做的某个功能 ios 代码 -&gt; 安卓代码迁移，大概 2000 行代码，5 个模块，基本符合预期吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926749\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d809604ef11ed53ed43baab585b7f20a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MacsedProtoss\" data-uid=\"563187\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>72</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MacsedProtoss\">MacsedProtoss</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:19:55 +08:00\">4h 33m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/stdout\">stdout</a> 我看我一个月 gpt 40B 也就是说用 v4 flash 也要 2000 还是 codex 大善人啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926777\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fa5538372f796d3f6299173b16ad5aaa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Xi\" data-uid=\"370\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>73</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Xi\">Xi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:32:30 +08:00\">4h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>智谱抢不到、kimi 套餐涨价，一个个耍猴，还得是看梁圣，不知道 deepseek v4 pro 还能提升多少。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926790\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cdca/41db/41900_normal.png?m=1711607036\" alt=\"icanfork\" data-uid=\"41900\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>74</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icanfork\">icanfork</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:38:36 +08:00\">4h 14m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>利好程序员，其他家也会降价的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926796\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/86f0/538b/138530_normal.png?m=1770014292\" alt=\"seven777\" data-uid=\"138530\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>75</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seven777\">seven777</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:41:55 +08:00\">4h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>腾讯家的 buddy 里的 DeepSeek-v4-flash  早就有了啊,是同一个玩意儿吗? buddy 里的也随着转\"正式版\"了?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926833\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/356b47a21c3e240d61f509a2d181f456?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Busy\" data-uid=\"47276\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>76</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Busy\">Busy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 10:57:30 +08:00\">3h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还行，日常使用看什么任务</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926890\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/98777f528009bb4298cda53a6646ecdf?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bigl9999\" data-uid=\"834411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>78</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bigl9999\">bigl9999</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 11:25:20 +08:00\">3h 28m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>下周 ai 应用又要走一波吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17926901\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a999/2f6c/19458_normal.png?m=1743308829\" alt=\"cskeleton\" data-uid=\"19458\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>79</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cskeleton\">cskeleton</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 11:31:28 +08:00\">3h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Xi\">Xi</a> #73 反了吧，现在是 zai 涨价，kimi 买不到</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17927081\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>82</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 13:18:09 +08:00\">1h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Dream4U\">Dream4U</a> 用 sub2api 共享, 然后用到 codex/cursor 等?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17927123\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>84</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 13:48:05 +08:00\">1h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Dream4U\">Dream4U</a> #83 cursor 你用吗? 套进去用, 效果如何</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"deepseek-v4-flash 正式版卡在 7 月最后一天发布，看评测数据很强，受不了智谱这种涨价方式，梁圣才是中国 AI 真正的希望 1 xqk111 23h 27m ago 看跑分，超过了 grok4.5 ，感觉很强啊 2 xqk111 23h 25m ago 也超过了 glm5.2 ，有点牛 3 seakingii 23h 24m ago 希望是真的.DS FLASH 才是真的用的起的模型 4 xiaomushen 23h 23m ago 21 是很强，但是 V 站上大部分，不都是非 Fable5 或 5.6Sol 不用的高级用户么？DS V4 Flash 强不强，和他们似乎关系不大吧 6 jxl594 OP 23h 19m ago 关键是，v4-flash 版本如果能达到 GLM5.2 的水平，那真是太便宜了，GLM5.2 和 KIMI3 可以暂时拜拜了 7 jokcylou 23h 15m ago via Android glm 股价 200 可期 9 jxl594 OP 23h 10m ago @TomatoCLI 对的，不过便宜比快更重要，后面看看小米 MIMO 能不能追上来。真是又期待，又害怕。能力强又便宜，那就能用得起了，但是，另一方面，程序员的含金量 K 线，感觉还在下降通道中。 11 yiranw09 23h 7m ago 刚才试了一下，感觉超过了之前的 dsv4pro ，关键似乎还降级了 13 vitozyl 23h 6m ago 能用+够用才是正途. 智谱被称为中国的 Anthropic, 但也不能照搬全学呀 14 Faintlike 22h 59m ago 1 280b 秒了 740b ，肥鲸，现在的你，强的可怕... 15 penll 22h 58m ago 非常牛逼，超过 GLM5.2 16 cjhyy 22h 57m ago 虽然 cc 和 codex 拉满了 但是自己总要搞点活啊 目前的感觉来看。模型的快速跃升期要到瓶颈了 60 分与 80 的差别可能不会那么大了 速度和成本应该下一个方向。之前自己充了 300 块 deepseek 用 pro 太慢了。flash 反而用的还顺手一点 做一些简单的活又便宜又快 18 jxl594 OP 22h 53m ago @cjhyy 确实，真正使用的时候，速度很重要，Qwen3.8-Max-Preview 运行一半就卡死在那里，GLM5.2 之前也慢的要死，正常工作几乎不可用。 20 jxl594 OP 22h 49m ago 1 要是梁圣再开源一个好用的 harness 项目，那真是功德圆满了 27 Dream4U 22h 23m ago 1 @xiaomushen #4 主要是 20X Codex 用不完，天天重置，三个人分摊，一个人两三百，真是最便宜的套餐了。DS 看 API 价格是便宜，但如果用 Pro ，一天几十上百很正常。 30 stdout 22h 13m ago 1kw token 不到 5 毛，用的越久 cache 命中越高，跟不要钱似的。 31 jxl594 OP 22h 10m ago @stdout 目前跑了 3.4kw token ，价格 1.5 ￥，去 TM 的 coding planning ，用多少花多少才是真香 32 yiranw09 22h 4m ago opencode go 可以用正式版本了但是需要在后台开启“启用部署在中国的模型” 33 stdout 22h 2m ago @jxl594 国内唯一个能用的很爽的，能和 grok4.5 流畅，解决大部分问题不用反复问，我就非常满足了。deepseek falsh 已经满足我的需求了。我下个月把 grok 切换过来。 36 stdout 22h 0m ago 7 我做空了 minimax 和智谱，赚多少就充多少给 deepseek 37 526457385 21h 59m ago 我问一下各位啊，哪个模型出来跑分不是吊打其他所有模型，你们看看你们现在正在用的什么模型 40 damila 21h 49m ago 我基本不看跑分，但是刚才体验了一下，效果远超个人预期，而且很快，这波是梁圣 41 EngelEyes 21h 43m ago 反正比隔壁\"性价比首选\"\"对标美系旗舰\"强。 44 jko123 21h 36m ago 不知道 DeepSeek v4 pro 正式版能不能达到 GPT5.6 SOL 水平，能达到那就棒了 46 albin504 21h 32m ago 利好腾讯啊。 腾讯的 AI 产品能用好低价、开源的模型，真是福音 48 BuffDog 21h 27m ago 我试了下相当不错，比 v4 pro 预览版强不少 49 kera0a 21h 15m ago via iPhone flash 都这忘了，pro 不得起飞咯 50 mgcnrx11 21h 10m ago 它自己公布的跑分下，有行小字：对于公开基准测试集中的 Code Agent 任务，正式版 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 使用 DeepSeek Harness (即将发布)的极简模式作为框架进行测试，并使用 max 档位，topp=0.95 ，temperature=1.0;不能看跑分就认为是模型进步了的，harness 对跑分的影响也非常大的 51 min 21h 5m ago 那 pro 出来了的话还得了？ 53 pinylin 18h 1m ago 3 我觉得智商不行， 非常简单的任务都错了。5.6 Luna-max 和 qwen3.7-max 都正常 55 ZeroDu 17h 12m ago deepseek ，glm 现在就差多模态。glm 这一涨价都赶上 gpt 了 56 raphx 16h 54m ago 不支持多模态...... 58 xiaomushen 16h 26m ago @ota 苹果用户的高贵怎么可以被国产安卓模型玷污？（ CodeX 用户只能算是半苹果半安卓） 59 xiaomushen 15h 47m ago 苹果用户只用苹果模型（ Fable5 ），绝对不会碰安卓模型。当然，苹果用户也许失业后送外卖，但部妨碍他们的高贵 61 oIIo 14h 49m ago 在 Codex 里高强度用了 4 个小时，审核 3d 即时战略游戏战斗模块/寻路模块代码（找 bug 、优化项）以及某功能模块实现，更复杂的问题还没试过。感觉 gpt-5.6 terra 没多大区别，关键是干完这些才花了不到 4 块钱.... 62 DinnyXu 13h 43m ago @congminhcap246 我看了一圈觉得 opus5 很好看，是一个旋风一样，gpt5.6 是不是没用对啊，也太撇了吧，我可是刚买的 plus 啊，这效果不应该啊，另外 ds 的很好看，想宇宙一样 63 cue 11h 6m ago via iPhone 重仓算力和光通信的同学又有福了，好日子还在后面呢🫠🫠 65 gdw1986 9h 8m ago via Android 让你们说得热血沸腾的，在考虑要不要直接换 DeepSeek 了，也不用折腾 codex 了 66 kuaner 8h 41m ago 1 精准狙击 GLM 涨价，显得无比滑稽 69 germain 5h 32m ago 我做了一个实操的 code review 和纠错实验，我让 Deepseek v4 flash (OpenCode)去 review 我一个在 GPT 5.6 Sol Ultra 做的项目，Deepseek v4 flash 找出了 41 个问题并实施了修改。然后我再用 GPT 5.6 Sol Ultra 去 review ds v4 flash 做的修改，sol 最终报 ds 准确找出了 38 个问题，3 个问题 sol 认为它自己写的没错并 revert 了 ds 的修改。在 38 个问题里，ds 正确修复了 26 个，其余 12 个修复不完整或不安全，随后 sol 完成了 12 个剩余问题的修复。 这个能力已经远远超出了我对 ds v4 flash 的能力的心理预期，再加上土一样的价格。。。 70 HinamiAoi 5h 2m ago 试了下不错，主要快。拿 AI 干活的就知道速度其实蛮重要的。做的某个功能 ios 代码 -> 安卓代码迁移，大概 2000 行代码，5 个模块，基本符合预期吧 72 MacsedProtoss 4h 33m ago via iPhone @stdout 我看我一个月 gpt 40B 也就是说用 v4 flash 也要 2000 还是 codex 大善人啊 73 Xi 4h 20m ago 智谱抢不到、kimi 套餐涨价，一个个耍猴，还得是看梁圣，不知道 deepseek v4 pro 还能提升多少。 74 icanfork 4h 14m ago via iPhone 利好程序员，其他家也会降价的 75 seven777 4h 11m ago 腾讯家的 buddy 里的 DeepSeek-v4-flash 早就有了啊,是同一个玩意儿吗? buddy 里的也随着转\"正式版\"了? 76 Busy 3h 55m ago 还行，日常使用看什么任务 78 bigl9999 3h 28m ago via iPhone 下周 ai 应用又要走一波吗 79 cskeleton 3h 22m ago @Xi #73 反了吧，现在是 zai 涨价，kimi 买不到 82 wzw 1h 35m ago @Dream4U 用 sub2api 共享, 然后用到 codex/cursor 等? 84 wzw 1h 5m ago @Dream4U #83 cursor 你用吗? 套进去用, 效果如何","fetched_at":"2026-08-01T06:55:39.320Z","ok":true}